  "_note": "像素火 v53 的行距契约：一行一个文本框（FROW0..FROW26），行距 = 脚本给的 ROW_STEP = floor(FONT × ROW_K)。FONT=44、ROW_K=0.95 ⇒ ROW_STEP=41。本用例只验'行距与行数'这种可在模拟器里查清的事（真机渲染细节模拟器验不了）。",
  "asserts": [
    {
      "kind": "tree",
      "name": "FROW0",
      "exists": true,
      "at": 1.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "tree",
      "name": "FROW26",
      "exists": true,
      "at": 1.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "control",
      "name": "FROW0",
      "field": "anchoredPositionY",
      "equals": 845,
      "at": 1.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "control",
      "name": "FROW1",
      "field": "anchoredPositionY",
      "equals": 804,
      "at": 1.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "control",
      "name": "FROW2",
      "field": "anchoredPositionY",
      "equals": 763,
      "at": 1.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "control",
      "name": "FROW5",
      "field": "anchoredPositionY",
      "equals": 640,
      "at": 1.2
    },
    {
      "kind": "control",
      "name": "FROW26",
      "field": "anchoredPositionY",
